    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '1.  Grab equipment from the hallway table. You can carry three items.

    2. 
    Find the cursed object. The EMF reader peaks right next to it.

    3.  Collect
    evidence, mark it above and identify the ghost.

    4.  Use the ritual items
    on the cursed object, in the right order.

    <i>A wrong step breaks the ritual
    and enrages the ghost.</i>'
